1 NAME Svein Herleiksson /Eigeland/
2 GIVN Svein Herleiksson
2 _MARNM Eigeland
2 NICK Sira
2 NICK Herleiksen
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1355
2 PLAC Ballestad
