2 CONT Torger Bergesen Årstad was born at Årstad, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, Norway. He was søkkrik. He died at Årstad, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, Norway. He married (--?--) Svensdtr, daughter of Svein Herleiksen Eigeland and Ragnhild Verbrandsdtr Å
