2 CONT
2 CONT She was first married to Vilhelm på Nedre Mæle, Årdal.
2 CONT
2 CONT They had one child:
2 CONT
2 CONT # Siri married to Kleng Omundson Steinsland. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage 2 JON, (also named Jone)  OLSON SKÅR TØTLAND FOSS b: 1545 in Foss, Hjelmeland, Norway
2 CONT
