1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Ifølge Slettebøe:
2 CONT
2 CONT Ziri Tengs med sine sønner Torger og Isak eide gods i 1624:
2 CONT
2 CONT 2 td. laks og 1 laup smør i Tengs, 2 huder i Sleveland, 1/2 pd. korn i Stokkeland, 2 sp. smør i Bakke, 9 sp. k. i Leidland og 62 sk. i Omdal.
2 CONT
2 CONT Han antar at hun het Isaksdatter, men mener selv å ikke være sikker.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ætt og Heim 1963: https://www.nb.no/items/49a8feacccdac4dbc4e1052c4bd159d3?page=121&s...
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Reference: Book
2 CONT
2 CONT Nes 2.I.50,26.
2 CONT
2 CONT Nes 2.I.50,275 Æ&H 1960 S.61 FF.1963 S.113-128.
2 CONT
2 CONT Siri Isaksdtr ? married lensmann Oluf Torgersen Tengs, son of Torgeir Svensen Slettebø and (--?--) Hansdtr Tengsareid. She married Olav Njeldsen Slettebø, son of Njeld Einarsen Tengs and (--?--) Torgersdtr Slettebø. She died after
2 CONC  1621 at Tengs 9., Eigersund, Rogaland, Norway.
2 CONT
2 CONT Lensmann Oluf Torgersen Tengs was lensmann. He died at Egersund, Eigersund, Rogaland, Norway. He married Siri Isaksdtr ?. He was born before 1563 at Tengs, Eigersund, Rogaland, Norway. He is mentioned Nes 2.I.50,275 Æ&H 1960 S.61 
2 CONC FF.1963 S.113-128.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ståle Eriksen Flikka married (--?--) Olufsdtr Tengs, daughter of lensmann Oluf Torgersen Tengs and Siri Isaksdtr ?. He was born before 1591 at Flikka Br.1.I., Nes, Vest Agder, Norway. He is mentioned Nes 2.I.50,26.
2 CONT
2 CONT (--?--) Olufsdtr Tengs was born at Tengs 9d, Eigersund, Rogaland, Norway. She married Ståle Eriksen Flikka, son of Eirik Stålesen Flikka and Anne Vermundsdtr Kvanvik. She is mentioned Nes 2.I.50.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Nevnt 1624
