2 CONT
2 CONT Ranni Halvorsdtr Egeland was born at Egeland ytre, Kvinesdal, Vest Agder., Norway. She married Carl Bjørnsen Møskeland son of Bjørn (--?--) Møskeland. She nevnt Lyngdal II.452.
2 CONT
2 CONT Carl Bjørnsen Møskeland married Ranni Halvorsdtr Egeland, daughter of Halvor Torgersen Egeland and Hilleborg Hujesdtr ?. He was born before 1574 at Møskeland, Lyngdal, Vest Agder, Norway. He nevnt Lyngdal. II.452.
2 CONT
2 CONT Kvås https://www.nb.no/items/6fc9c1daeebd2d4a67b5ccd097c3fa03?page=235
