1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ID: I2419 
2 CONT
2 CONT Name: Tormod OLAVSSON 
2 CONT
2 CONT Given Name: Tormod 
2 CONT
2 CONT Surname: Olavsson 
2 CONT
2 CONT NSFX: Foss 
2 CONT
2 CONT Sex: M 
2 CONT
2 CONT Title: Foss 
2 CONT
2 CONT Note: 
2 CONT
2 CONT Tormod Olavsson operated a farm of 2 laupar smør at Foss and was
2 CONT
2 CONT undoubtedly one of the largest landowners of his time in Hjelmeland.
2 CONT
2 CONT Tormod is mentioned a couple times in the skiprede records. He was
2 CONT
2 CONT involved in a court case concerning the deserted farm, Vik under
2 CONT
2 CONT "Wesbbystad" in Sunnhordland. Tormod declared that he was the rightful
2 CONT
2 CONT owner of this land, but he lost the case. Tormod also represented
2 CONT
2 CONT Hjelmeland at the coronation of King Kristian IV at Oslo in 1591.
2 CONT
2 CONT 1 2 3 4 5 6 2 3 4 5 
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth: ABT 1535 in Foss gård #17, Hjelmeland, Rogaland, Norway 
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth: ABT 1535 in Foss gård #17, Hjelmeland, Rogaland, Norway 
2 CONT
2 CONT Death: BEF 1606 in Foss gård #17, Hjelmeland, Rogaland, Norway 
2 CONT
2 CONT Death: BEF 1606 in Foss gård #17, Hjelmeland, Rogaland, Norway 
2 CONT
2 CONT Probate: 16 APR 1606 Hjelmeland, Rogaland, Norway 
2 CONT
2 CONT Probate: 16 APR 1606 Hjelmeland, Rogaland, Norway
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Olav* JONSSON b: 1510 in Tøtland gård #39, Hjelmeland, Rogaland, Norway 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother: Siri* ODDSDATTER b: ABT 1510 in Fevoll gård #53, Hjelmeland, Rogaland, Norway
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage 1 Anna ORMSDATTER b: ABT 1539 in Byre gård #16, Fister, Rogaland, Norway
2 CONT
2 CONT Married: ABT 1580 in Hjelmeland, Rogaland, Norway 7 1 2
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT
2 CONT  Udbjørg TORMODSDATTER b: ABT 1555 in Foss gård #17, Hjelmeland, Rogaland, Norway
2 CONT
2 CONT  Peder TORMODSSON b: ABT 1581 in Foss gård #17, Hjelmeland, Rogaland, Norway
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources:
2 CONT
2 CONT Abbrev: Soga Om Vats bygdebok
2 CONT
2 CONT Title: Soga Om Vats (Gard og ætt i gamle Vats Herad)
2 CONT
2 CONT Author: Nils Dybdal-Holthe 
2 CONT
2 CONT Abbrev: Hjelmeland Gardar og folk
