1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 676. Ole Reidarson, son of Reidar Knudson and Anna Steinsdotter, was born circa 1585 in Barkeland, Jelsa, Rogaland, NOR and died circa 1653 in Atletveit, Sjernarøy, Rogaland, NOR at age 68.  Ole married Kristi Jons
2 CONC dotter circa 1610 in Hjelmeland kyrkje, Hjelmeland, Rogaland, NOR.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children from this marriage were:
2 CONT
2 CONT           i.  Jon Olson was born circa 1610 in Atletveit, Sjernarøy, Rogaland, NOR and died in Ohm, Vats, Rogaland, NOR. Jon married Astrid Gunnarsdotter circa 1634 in Vats kyrkje, Vats, Rogaland, NOR. They had no children. 
2 CONT          ii.  Anna Olsdotter was born in 1615 in Atletveit, Sjernarøy, Rogaland, NOR and died in Alvseike, Vats, Rogaland, NOR. Anna married Ole Alvson circa 1633 in Sjernarøy kyrkje, Sjernarøy, Rogaland, NOR. Anna next married Jo
2 CONC hannes Torbjørnson in 1642 in Vats kyrkje, Vats, Rogaland, NOR.  338     iii.  Knud Olson. Knud married Larsdotter circa 1635 in Vats kyrkje, Vats, Rogaland, NOR. Knud next married Anna Olsdotter on 9. Jul 1655 in Fister kyrkje, F
2 CONC ister, Rogaland, NOR. 
2 CONT          iv.  Ole Olson was born in 1629 in Atletveit, Sjernarøy, Rogaland, NOR and died circa 1695 in Døvik litle, Årdal, Rogaland, NOR at age 66. 
2 CONT           v.  Helga Olsdotter was born circa 1630 in Atletveit, Sjernarøy, Rogaland, NOR and died in 1673 in Vadla, Årdal, Rogaland, NOR at age 43. Helga married Ole Reiarson d. y. circa 1650 in Sjernarøy kyrkje, Sjernarøy, Rogala
2 CONC nd, NOR. 
