1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Is there any ''evidence'' that Mikkel Tothammer had a daughter named Marie Mikkelsdatter that was married to Jon Reiarsen Sandsmork?''' No such wife is mentioned in [https://www.nb.no/items/7030d184bbc50ed3e1dac
2 CONC 0748f60b679?page=442 "Heskestad sokn: Gard, ætt og folk"]. [https://www.wisted.net/tothammer.html "Stein Norem Wisteds Ættesoge for Sokndal"] speculates that Mikkel had a daughter named Marit, but does not link her to Jon Reiarsen
2 CONC  Sandsmork. [https://www.nb.no/items/7030d184bbc50ed3e1dac0748f60b679?page=442 "Heskestad sokn: Gard, ætt og folk"] states that Jon Reiarsen Sandsmork was married to Johanne Mikkelsdatter.
