2 CONT
2 CONT Anna Oddsdtr Sæveland was born at Sæveland, Herad, Vest Agder, Norway. She married Ole (--?--). She married Ånen Tollefsen Briseid, son of Tollef (--?--) Briseid. She died after 1618 at Briseid, Herad, Vest Agder, Norway.
