1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Reference: Book
2 CONT
2 CONT Lyngdal III. 182.
2 CONT
2 CONT Kvinesdal I. 79,
2 CONT
2 CONT Lyngdal II.276,
2 CONT
2 CONT Lyngdal II.561,
2 CONT
2 CONT Lyngdal II.578.
2 CONT
2 CONT Anna Salvesdtr Rom was born at Rom, Lyngdal, Vest Agder, Norway. She married Hågen Sigbjørnsen Berge, son of Sigbjørn Berge Berge, before 1636. She married Finkel Kollungsen Udland, son of Kollung (--?--) Udland and Asgjerd (--?--
2 CONC ) Udland, after
2 CONT
2 CONT 1650. She died circa 1697 at Berge ytre, Lyngdal, Vest Agder, Norway. She left a will on 31 Mar 1697 at Trælskår. She Nevnt Kvinesdal I. 79, Lyngdal II. 276, 561, 578.
2 CONT
2 CONT Hågen Sigbjørnsen Berge was born before 1616 at Berge ytre, Lyngdal, Vest Agder, Norway. He married Anna Salvesdtr Rom, daughter of Salve Bjørnsen Rom, before 1636. He died after 1650 at Berge ytre, Lyngdal, Vest Agder, Norway.
