1 NAME Eiel Eilsen /Nesheim/
2 GIVN Eiel Eilsen
2 SURN Nesheim
2 _MARNM Alstveit
2 NICK Baustad
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1639
2 PLAC Baustad br. 5
2 ADDR
3 CITY Nedstrand
3 STAE Rogaland
3 CTRY Norway
