2 CONC /2 laup of butter. Of this, the son Bjørn received 1/2 pd. in Sørvåg. Berta and Siri each got 1 pd. and 9 buckets of grain in Norheim. Torborg and Sissel each received 4 bushels of grain in Norheim, 3 bushels of grain in Lund and 
2 CONC 1/2 pd. butter in Sørvåg. Each sister liquor was 41 dollars, 5 ort and 5 shillings.
2 CONT
2 CONT 17. Ola Larsson Jørstad, f. 1626, sk. 5. juni 1690. Han var son åt lensmann Lars Asgautson Jørstad og kone Siri Olsdtr. Aukland. Sjå Jørstad nr. 4 c. 
