2 CONT Mother Kari Gudmundsdtr.Fosen
2 CONT Father Bjørn Olavsson "Olsen" Aukland
2 CONT
2 CONT Born in Våle, Vestfold, Norway on 1625 to Bjørn Olavsson "Olsen" Aukland and Kari Gudmundsdtr.Fosen. Kari Olavsen Aukland married Jan Cornelius.. deRyck and had 1 child. She passed away on 1678 in New York, United States.
