2 CONT Hans Andersen Gullestad married Ragnhild (--?--). He was born before 1568 at Gullestad, Kvinesdal, Vest Agder, Norway. He lived between 1584 and 1608 at Gullestad, Kvinesdal, Vest Agder, Norway. He died circa 1618 at Egeland ytre,
2 CONC  Kvinesdal, Vest Agder, Norway. He nevnt Kvinesdal. I. 630-. II. 79, 86.
