2 CONT '''Is there any evidence that this was a son of Tollef Pedersen Bjerkreim/ Hellvik/ Helleren/ Heskestad/ Rapstad (Bjerkreim) ? He seems to be too old for that and is not listed as a son in [https://www.nb.no/items/86f2120d1cf6c399
2 CONC be7d31a8aba2e7fa?page=141 "Bjerkreimboka"] or in [https://www.nb.no/items/876d3c181419a05b42a5169800396780?page=737 "Helleland sokn gard, ætt og folk"].'''
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
