2 CONT ----
2 CONT '''Probate record (10-09-1696; Enkok had died, and the heirs were listed as the widow, Karen Atlaksdatter, and their 3 children: Marta Gitlesdatter Hestad [erroneously]; Enok Gitlesen Bjerkreim; and Anne Gitlesdatter Bjerkreim):''
2 CONC '
