1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Probate record (11-05-1739; both Jakob and his II wife Gjertrud d.e. had died, without any children in their marriage. The heirs after Jakob were listed as 4 children with his I wife: Markus; Helga; Guri; and Si
2 CONC ri, who had died but left 6 children with her husband Ole Olsen. The heirs after Gjertrud were listed as her siblings: Brynild Torkelsen; Elling Torkelsen; Siri Torkelsdatter d.e., married to Torkel Hansen[?] Hogstad [at Hidra]; S
2 CONC iri Torkelsdatter d.y., married to Hans Andersen Lavoll; Gjertrud d.y. Torkelsdatter, married to Eivind Reiarsen Flikka; Birgitte Torkelsdatter, who had died but left several children with her husband Torkel):'''
