1 NOTE {geni:about_me} skifte 31 October 1704, indicates that Svane Ansteensdatter was Engel's #1 wife, and mother of daughters:  Barbara (m. her #2 Joen Tharaldsen); Torbor (m. Gunder Togersen); Marthe (dead - m. Torkil Olsen, son Jacob
2 CONC  Torkilsen); Gunild (m. Ole Thommesen); & Gundlev (m. Thomes Thoresen).  With his #2 wife Toene Nielsdatter, had son Anders Engelsen.  No children with #3 wife left after his death:  Maren Salvesdatter.  But she was first m. to Da
2 CONC vid Davidsen Moll (sk. 26 Sept. 1676)(children: David, Willum, Salve David sonner; Anne, Ragnild, & Maren Davids daughters.)  Son Salve Davidsen had skifte 31 January 1700 & son David Davidsen's skifte was immediately after Salve'
2 CONC s.  And some of David's surviving children were left in the care of 2 of Engel's sons-in-law.    Also, skifte of daughter Barbara in 1740 showed that Ingebret Ingebretsen was her father's brother.     It was also found that Engel 
2 CONC had another brother Tellef, who died before 1677.
2 CONT
