1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ''''Sogneprestenes manntall 1664-1666 (10-02-1664; Lars is listed at Li with no indication of his age at the time):'''
2 CONT RA, Sogneprestenes manntall 1664-1666, nr. 17: Jæren prosti og Dalane prosti, 1664-1666, s. 250-251. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/ft10051005180140
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Fogdenes og sorenskrivernes manntall 1664-1666 (12-05-1664; Lars is claimed to be 26 years old at the time):'''
2 CONT RA, Fogdenes og sorenskrivernes manntall 1664-1666, nr. 10: Lista len, 1664, s. 42-43. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/ft10051005312030
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Fogdenes og sorenskrivernes manntall 1664-1666 (not dated; Lars is claimed to be 26 years old at the time):'''
2 CONT RA, Fogdenes og sorenskrivernes manntall 1664-1666, nr. 10: Lista len, 1664, s. 168-169. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/ft10051005312096
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Probate record (22-09-1721; both Lars and Gunhild had died, and the heirs were listed as their children: Hans, Vermund, Lars and Sigbjørn, as well as their half-sister Guri Hansdatter [who must be Gunhild's daughter with an ear
2 CONC lier husband, named Hans]):'''
2 CONT Lister sorenskriveri, SAK/1221-0003/H/Hc/L0018: Skifteprotokoll nr 18 med register, 1718-1723, s. 269b-270a. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/sk20081029380676
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Probate record after his wife's brother Ingvar Sigbjørnsen (30-08-1715; Ingvar had died, and Gunhild Sigbjørnsdatter and her husband Lars Olsen Li are listed among the heirs):'''
2 CONT Lister sorenskriveri, SAK/1221-0003/H/Hc/L0015: Skifteprotokoll nr 15 med register, 1714-1718, s. 86b-87a. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/sk20081029370099
2 CONT ----
2 CONT '''Probate record (22-09-1721; both Lars and Gunhild had died, and the heirs were listed as their children: Hans, Vermund, Lars and Sigbjørn, as well as their half-sister Guri Hansdatter [who must be Gunhild's daughter with an ear
2 CONC lier husband, named Hans]):'''
2 CONT Lister sorenskriveri, AV/SAK-1221-0003/H, s. 23023. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/sk11214091223025
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Probate record after his wife's brother Ingvar Sigbjørnsen (30-08-1715; Ingvar had died, and Gunhild Sigbjørnsdatter and her husband Lars Olsen Li are listed among the heirs):'''
2 CONT Lister sorenskriveri, AV/SAK-1221-0003/H, s. 5545. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/sk11214091205545
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Probate record after his mother (12-05-1675; the mother had died, and Lars Li is listed among the heirs):'''
2 CONT Jæren og Dalane sorenskriveri, SAST/A-100306/5/50BA/L0002: SKIFTEPROTOKOLL. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/sk20081106650278
2 CONT ----
2 CONT * https://www.nb.no/items/6f6f6343ed582f8d0a24578c5b5d5119?page=145&searchText=%22randi%20ingvorsdatter%22%22
2 CONT * [https://www.nb.no/items/e4c1868422e6e51ea5fa87ac3cc8ccaa?page=102 "Bakke bygdebok: Gards- og slektshistorie" Del 1, Gardsnr. 116-134 (Ramsli, Bnr. 2, Der framme, 3. Ole Nilsson Ramsli, pp. 99-100)]
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Lars Olsen Li (Ramsli)' must be the same person as the 'Lauritz Oluffssøn' (26 years old, thus born about 1638) listed at Li in the 1664 Manntall. According to a [https://www.digitalarkivet.no/sk20081029370099 probate dated 30-08-
2 CONC 1715], the sister of the deceased was still alive and named Gunhild Sigbjørnsdatter Li, and was married to Lars Olsen Li. There was a probate after this Gunhild Sigbjørnsdatter Li, [https://www.digitalarkivet.no/sk20081029380676da
2 CONC ted 22-09-1721], at which her husband, who had also died, is named Lars Larsen Li. This Lars Larsen Li is also listed at [https://www.nb.no/items/URN:NBN:no-nb_digibok_2010082603004?page=265 Li in Sokneprest Schyttes manntall of 1
2 CONC 718], at which time he is claimed to have been 70 yeas old, farm user for 40 years, and the father of another Lars Larsen. 45 years old, who again had a son named Lars. '''It seems likely that the Lars Larsen listed in the probate
2 CONC  of 1721, Manntall of 1718, and the Lars Olsen listed in the 1715 probate and the 1664 Manntall is one and the same person'''.
2 CONT ----
