2 CONT
2 CONT Sigbjørn Corsmissen Feda was born in 1613 at Feda, Feda, Vest Agder, Norway. He married Turid Olufsdtr Heggland, daughter of Olluf Svensen Reppen, before 1647. He married Siri Hågansdtr Øyse, daughter of Hågan Stålesen Øyset and M
2 CONC agnhild Gunnersdtr Øyset. He died before 1675 at Røyland Br.1.IV, Nes, Vest Agder, Norway. He left a will on 23 Mar 1678 at Røydland. He witnessed the will of Siri Hågansdtr
2 CONT
2 CONT Øyse on 20 Apr 1696 at Seland.
2 CONT
2 CONT Turid Olufsdtr Heggland died at Feda, Feda, Vest Agder, Norway. Her married name was Røyland. She was born before 1620 at Heggland, Gyland, Vest Agder, Norway. She married Sigbjørn Corsmissen Feda (5562), son of Corsmis (--?--) Te
2 CONC såk, before 1647.
2 CONT
2 CONT Alt. birth dates c. 1620 and 1630.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.nb.no/items/ea93d9621cfda554f62709e9a9d68fb0?page=533&searchText=%22sigbj%C3%B8rn%20corsmisson%22
